[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0353","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50524","title":"微软 .NET 拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET TLS/SSL (System.Net.Security) 存在拒绝服务漏洞，源于对 TLS 握手过程中输入类型验证不当 (CWE-1287)。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需通过网络发送精心构造的畸形 TLS 握手请求，即可触发 .NET 运行时在处理 TLS 握手时的异常，导致目标应用程序崩溃或变得无响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0.0-8.0.28、.NET 9.0.0-9.0.17 及 .NET 10.0.0-10.0.9 所有受支持平台 (Linux/macOS/Windows、x64/ARM/ARM64/Musl) 的 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime 运行时包，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5 (HIGH，AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H)，攻击向)。攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互，仅通过网络发送恶意 TLS 握手包即可远程触发拒绝服务。微软已在 .NET 8.0.29、9.0.18、10.0.10 版本中修复，受影响的自包含应用需重新编译部署修复版运行时。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50524","GHSA-w7cw-xp7h-6j5j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 .NET 运行时到修复版本：.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29。通过运行 `dotnet --info` 检查当前版本，通过 Visual Studio 更新或下载安装最新 SDK/Runtime。引用 Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime 等易受攻击 NuGet 包的项目，需更新包引用至对应修复版本。更新后必须重启所有 .NET 应用程序使补丁生效。自包含部署应用需重新编译并重新部署。临时缓解措施：在网络层面限制非受信来源的 TLS 连接，或配置防火墙限制 TLS 握手来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50524","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50524.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50524.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50524.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50524","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50524.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-arm/CVE-2026-50524.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50524.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50524.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9d5a7d1c566e3b3d2231325259c035dd0347ef0d/cve/CVE-2026-50524.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0292","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47304","title":"Microsoft .NET XML 加密安全功能绕过漏洞","description":".NET XML 加密实现（System.Security.Cryptography.Xml）中存在安全功能绕过漏洞，源于对加密签名的验证不充分（CWE-347）。未经授权的远程攻击者可在无需身份认证和用户交互的情况下，通过网络向受影响系统发送特制的 XML 加密数据，绕过加密保护机制并访问被加密的敏感信息，进而导致机密性、完整性和可用性受损。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（≤8.0.28）、.NET 9.0（≤9.0.17）及 .NET 10.0（≤10.0.9）版本中 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。Microsoft 已发布 NuGet 包更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47304","GHSA-g8r8-53c2-pm3f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-22T16:17:25Z","remediation":"将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml NuGet 包升级至修复版本：.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10。可通过 `dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml` 命令或 Visual Studio NuGet 包管理器更新，更新后重新编译部署应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-47304","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47304.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-47304.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-47304","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47304.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/System.Security.Cryptography.Xml/CVE-2026-47304.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-47304.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47304.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6f230e22fac20dffc313381d5ad9ce3ce926b546/cve/CVE-2026-47304.html","https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-identity-web/blob/dba8a0c46bb1153dc2b782c6484d92d5beb56bc5/Directory.Build.props"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0290","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47300","title":"Microsoft ASP.NET Core Negotiate 认证特权提升漏洞","description":"ASP.NET Core Negotiate 认证组件中存在认证算法实现缺陷漏洞（CWE-303），由于 Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.Negotiate 包对身份验证算法的实现不正确，已获得授权的攻击者可通过网络向目标 ASP.NET Core 应用发送特制的认证请求，利用 Negotiate 认证与 LDAP 角色查询组合场景下的逻辑缺陷，将自身权限提升至管理员级别。该漏洞影响 .NET 8/9/10 及对应的 Visual Studio 产品，仅在使用 Negotiate 认证且通过 LDAP 检索角色信息时受影响。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2026 年 7 月安全更新中发布修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47300","GHSA-8prm-248r-h957"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T19:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-22T17:33:12Z","remediation":"将 Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.Negotiate 包升级至 .NET 8.0.29 / .NET 9.0.18 / .NET 10.0.10 及以上版本；通过 `dotnet --info` 确认当前版本，在项目文件中更新 PackageReference 版本号后重新生成部署。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 Negotiate 认证方式或避免使用 LDAP 检索角色信息作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-47300","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47300.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-47300.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47300.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-47300","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47300.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-47300.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-47300.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-47300/poc.py","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/adeb612bf3a5b4f2b8426bc5720e617d432d1455/cve/CVE-2026-47300.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0647","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0647.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-57108","title":"Microsoft .NET X.509证书解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET 运行时密码学层（CryptoNative_GetX509NameInfo）在解析 X.509 证书时存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843）。攻击者可构造特制证书，利用类型混淆导致运行时内存访问异常，触发拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可通过网络远程触发，影响 .NET 8/9/10 在 Linux 和 macOS 平台上的所有架构版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2026 年 7 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-57108","GHSA-rp2p-6cmp-jxj9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T18:18:35Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:18:01Z","remediation":"将 .NET 运行时升级到已修复版本：.NET 8.0 升级到 8.0.29 或更高，.NET 9.0 升级到 9.0.18 或更高，.NET 10.0 升级到 10.0.10 或更高。可通过 `dotnet --info` 查看当前版本，通过 NuGet 更新 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime 包引用，或通过 Visual Studio 更新 .NET SDK。自包含部署的应用需重新编译并重新部署。重启应用使更新生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-57108","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2026/57xxx/CVE-2026-57108.json","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/9.0/cve.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2026/57xxx/CVE-2026-57108.json","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/8.0/cve.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/8.0/8.0.29/8.0.29.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/9.0/9.0.18/9.0.18.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/10.0/10.0.10/10.0.10.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-57108.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-57108.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0647.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0858","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0858.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59891","title":"Sigstore @sigstore/oci 注册表凭据混淆漏洞","description":"@sigstore/oci 中的 getRegistryCredentials() 函数在读取 Docker 配置文件 (~/.docker/config.json) 时，使用子字符串匹配而非精确主机名匹配来选择认证凭据。当目标镜像仓库地址与已配置的认证密钥存在子串包含关系时（如攻击者控制的 cr.io 匹配已配置的 ghcr.io），攻击者可通过控制目标镜像仓库地址，诱使系统将高权限的注册表凭据（如 GHCR、Docker Hub 或云注册表令牌）发送至其控制的恶意注册表，导致凭据泄露。该漏洞影响 @sigstore/oci <= 0.7.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.6，危害等级严重。利用条件包括：主机 Docker 配置中存在注册表凭据、目标注册表地址可被不可信来源影响、攻击者控制的注册表主机名与已配置密钥存在子串关系。已在 @sigstore/oci@0.7.1 中修复，修复方案为采用精确主机名匹配并规范化 URL 格式。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59891","GHSA-pf56-329r-95rw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:15Z","updated":"2026-07-21T19:17:12Z","remediation":"将 `@sigstore/oci` 升级至 0.7.1 或以上版本，该版本已将凭据匹配方式从子串匹配改为精确主机名匹配。如无法升级，确保传入 `@sigstore/oci` 的镜像仓库地址来自可信源，避免由不可信方控制目标 registry；同时限制 Docker 配置中仅保留必要凭据，避免注册表主机名存在子串包含关系，并使用短时效令牌缩小影响面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/commit/85c58380758b97ce1b74ef470e55cc21f9d3aa89","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/releases/tag/%40sigstore%2Foci%400.7.1","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/security/advisories/GHSA-pf56-329r-95rw","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2026/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5f7b2444b1b2b1b019b434748bbb88035c2136a4/2026/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59891.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59891.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/@sigstore/oci/CVE-2026-59891.yml","https://github.com/gyubin02/cve-2026-59891-control-lab"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0858.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0855","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0855.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59888","title":"FasterXML jackson-databind Java Record @JsonIgnore 属性绕过漏洞","description":"Jackson-databind 在处理 Java Record 类型的反序列化时存在 @JsonIgnore 注解绕过漏洞。当 Record 类结合 PropertyNamingStrategy（属性命名策略）使用时，POJOPropertiesCollector._removeUnwantedIgnorals() 方法在 _renameUsing() 应用命名策略之前，先以原始隐式名称记录了被 @JsonIgnore 标记的组件。重命名后，_ignoredPropertyNames 仍仅持有重命名前的名称，导致 _ignorableProps 基于过期的键构建，使得重命名后的 JSON 键能够绕过 IgnorePropertiesUtil.shouldIgnore() 检查并被赋值给 Record 的构造参数。攻击者可利用此漏洞通过构造特制的 JSON 数据，将原本应被忽略的内部或敏感属性（如角色、权限标志等）注入到反序列化结果中，导致信息泄露或权限提升。该漏洞影响 jackson-databind 2.15.0 至 2.18.8、2.19.0 至 2.21.4 以及 3.0.0 至 3.1.4 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。已在 2.18.8、2.21.4 和 3.1.4 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59888","GHSA-3pjw-73gf-8qr5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:15Z","updated":"2026-07-15T20:18:23Z","remediation":"升级 jackson-databind 至修复版本：2.15.x 分支升级到 2.18.8 及以上，2.19.x 分支升级到 2.21.4 及以上，3.x 分支升级到 3.1.4 及以上。如无法立即升级，避免在 Java Record 上同时使用 @JsonIgnore 和 PropertyNamingStrategy，或改用普通 POJO 类替代 Record。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/commit/baa2cdf5ca2b2717fbb88d91955d69d8651df3e4","https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/commit/c7c678360624da5bc7eed2152789fa522880db9d","https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/pull/5974","https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/security/advisories/GHSA-3pjw-73gf-8qr5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59888.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-59888"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0855.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0853","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0853.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59886","title":"pyasn1 ASN.1库不受控制的资源消耗漏洞","description":"pyasn1 是 Python 生态中通用的 ASN.1 编解码库。在 0.6.4 之前版本中，其 univ.Real 类型在将 (尾数, 基数, 指数) 值转换为 Python float 时使用了精确的大整数幂运算。攻击者可以构造一个仅数字节长的 BER/CER/DER 编码 REAL 值，其中包含极大的指数，触发 float 转换（如 prettyPrint()、str()、比较运算、算术运算、int() 或显式 float() 调用）时会导致 CPU 和内存被过度消耗，造成进程挂起，形成拒绝服务。解码操作本身不会触发该问题，但任何对解码后的 Real 对象进行打印、日志记录或比较的操作均会受影响。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络触发。修复版本为 pyasn1 0.6.4。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59886","GHSA-hm4w-wwcw-mr6r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:15Z","updated":"2026-07-21T14:38:13Z","remediation":"立即将 pyasn1 升级至 0.6.4 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade pyasn1`）。如无法升级，避免对不可信来源解码后的 Real 对象执行 prettyPrint()、str()、比较、算术运算或 float() 转换，改用原始 (mantissa, base, exponent) 元组处理数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/commit/e60c691cb91addb8fcefa2f537e85ede6fb1e886","https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/releases/tag/v0.6.4","https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/security/advisories/GHSA-hm4w-wwcw-mr6r","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub/blob/505742a2eb776e000b13b871b40837277232c241/docker/snippets/ingestion/constraints.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59886.json","https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow/blob/3fd4ead26b427bf7e51ebc17a42039e02415c2af/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0853.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0852","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0852.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59885","title":"pyasn1 ASN.1 OID处理二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"pyasn1 是一个用于 Python 的通用 ASN.1 库，其 BER/CER/DER 解码器在处理 OBJECT IDENTIFIER 和 RELATIVE-OID 值时存在二次复杂度问题。攻击者可构造包含大量弧段（arcs）的小型恶意载荷（数十 KB），当应用程序解码该数据时，每个 decode() 调用将消耗数秒 CPU 时间，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有解码不可信 ASN.1 数据的应用场景，包括证书解析、LDAP、SNMP、Kerberos 等。编码器在重新编码攻击者提供的值时也存在相同问题。pyasn1 0.6.4 版本已修复此漏洞，将弧段累积算法改为线性时间复杂度。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59885","GHSA-8ppf-4f7h-5ppj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:14Z","updated":"2026-07-21T14:38:21Z","remediation":"立即将 pyasn1 升级至 0.6.4 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade pyasn1），该版本已将 OID 弧累积算法改为线性时间复杂度。如无法升级，可在解码前限制不可信 ASN.1 输入数据大小（建议不超过 1KB），或使用防火墙/反向代理过滤包含大量 OID 弧的畸形 ASN.1 载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/commit/45bdb19eb7df4b3780fe9c912c63e99bffc39dd9","https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/releases/tag/v0.6.4","https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/security/advisories/GHSA-8ppf-4f7h-5ppj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub/blob/505742a2eb776e000b13b871b40837277232c241/docker/snippets/ingestion/constraints.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59885.json","https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow/blob/3fd4ead26b427bf7e51ebc17a42039e02415c2af/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0852.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0851","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0851.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59884","title":"pyasn1 BER/CER/DER 解码器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"pyasn1 的 BER 解码器（被 CER 和 DER 编解码器共用）在解析长格式标签 ID 时，通过循环累加续传字节且未对标签 ID 大小设置上限，攻击者可构造特制的 ASN.1 数据包触发该漏洞。CPU 消耗随输入大小呈二次增长，约 1 MB 的恶意输入即可导致超过一分钟的 CPU 占用；在 Python 3.11+ 上，超大的标签 ID 还会在格式化错误消息时触发未捕获的 ValueError 异常，绕过调用方预期的 PyAsn1Error 异常处理。任何解码不可信 BER/CER/DER 输入的应用均受影响。该漏洞已在 pyasn1 0.6.4 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59884","GHSA-m4p7-r5rc-7g4j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:14Z","updated":"2026-07-21T14:37:52Z","remediation":"升级 pyasn1 至 0.6.4 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade pyasn1）。如无法立即升级，在调用 decode() 前限制不可信输入的大小（如限制为 1MB），并在应用层捕获所有异常类型（包括 ValueError）以防止绕过错误处理逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/commit/628e36ecbb5277a3f01572ce418ef54271b165a5","https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/releases/tag/v0.6.4","https://github.com/pyasn1/pyasn1/security/advisories/GHSA-m4p7-r5rc-7g4j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59884.json","https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow/blob/3fd4ead26b427bf7e51ebc17a42039e02415c2af/pyproject.toml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59884.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0851.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0688","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0688.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59200","title":"Pillow PdfParser.PdfStream 压缩炸弹型服务拒绝漏洞","description":"Pillow 图像库的 PdfParser 模块存在解压缩炸弹漏洞。在 `PdfStream.decode()` 方法中，该实现调用 `zlib.decompress()` 时使用 PDF 流长度字段的值作为 `bufsize` 参数，但 Python 的 `zlib.decompress()` 的 `bufsize` 参数只是初始缓冲区大小的提示，不是最大限制。一个精心构造的 FlateDecode 压缩流可以在 PDF 文件尺寸仅为 ~950KB 的情况下解压缩为 1GB 内存，导致运行该代码的服务器内存耗尽或崩溃。攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互，只需提交恶意 PDF 文件即可触发此漏洞。该问题影响所有使用 PIL.PdfParser 解析可信 PDF 文件的应用程序，从 Pillow 5.1.0 版本到 12.3.0 版本均存在，已在 12.3.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59200","GHSA-jjj6-mw9f-p565"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:14Z","updated":"2026-07-21T15:52:40Z","remediation":"升级 Pillow 到 12.3.0 或更高版本，并确保应用程序始终使用最新版本，避免使用受影响的 5.1.0 到 12.2.x 版本。如无法立即更新，可通过将最大允许解压缩大小限制设置为 200MB 进行临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/f7a31ea75e460e108c37126da1f47812f21f6b09","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9718","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-jjj6-mw9f-p565","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59200.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59200.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/8fd2ccd9bd5df072c2b7289fae39225709d0f7f9/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-59200.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0688.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0685","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59197","title":"Pillow 图像过滤器堆溢出写漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Pillow 图像处理库的 RankFilter 滤镜 API 存在整数溢出导致的堆越界写入漏洞。在 `ImageFilter.RankFilter.filter()` 中，调用 `image.expand(size // 2, size // 2)` 扩展图像边界时未先校验滤镜尺寸，当传入极大奇数尺寸（如 4294967295）时，扩展边距计算为 INT_MAX，导致 `ImagingExpand()` 使用未检查的有符号整数运算计算输出尺寸发生溢出回绕，后续边界扩展循环写入超出已分配堆内存。该漏洞影响 Pillow 1.0 至 12.2.0 所有版本，已在 12.3.0 中修复。攻击者可通过构造恶意滤镜尺寸参数（如 MedianFilter(4294967295)）触发漏洞，若攻击者同时可控输入图像数据，越界写入的像素值可被攻击者控制（模式 \"I\"/\"F\" 为 4 字节写入），导致堆内存破坏，可造成拒绝服务或潜在远程代码执行。CVSS 3.1 评分 8.2（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需权限、无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59197","GHSA-xj96-63gp-2gmr"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:14Z","updated":"2026-07-21T19:17:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Pillow 到 12.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade Pillow）。若暂时无法升级，请在代码层面限制 RankFilter/MedianFilter/MinFilter/MaxFilter 的 size 参数不超过合理范围（建议 ≤1000），并避免将不可信用户输入直接传递给滤镜 size 参数。修复版本已在 GitHub PR #9695 和 12.3.0 版本中发布，包含 RankFilter.filter() 调用 image.expand() 前的 size 校验及 ImagingExpand() 的溢出防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/cce3bdb867c77a3420261ed1bfdb6b0787ec8fc1","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9695","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-xj96-63gp-2gmr","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2026/CVE-2026-59197.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59197.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-591xx/CVE-2026-59197.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59197.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0641","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0641.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56170","title":"Microsoft ASP.NET Core SignalR 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ASP.NET Core SignalR 存在资源无限制分配漏洞（CWE-770），源于 Stateful Reconnect 功能在处理客户端重连请求时未对资源分配进行有效限制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量精心构造的 Stateful Reconnect 请求，耗尽服务器资源，导致其他合法用户无法正常使用 SignalR 服务，形成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8、.NET 9 和 .NET 10 版本中使用 SignalR 且启用了 Stateful Reconnect 的应用程序，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2026 年 7 月安全更新中发布修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56170","GHSA-j8gr-8fp3-5q5h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:56Z","remediation":"将 Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime 包升级到修复版本：.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.6，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.15，.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.26。运行 `dotnet --info` 确认当前版本，通过 NuGet 包管理器或 Visual Studio 更新对应包引用。如无法立即升级，可在 SignalR 连接中禁用 Stateful Reconnect 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-56170","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-56170.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-561xx/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-56170","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0eb937d6858d58d5e2a369c15112b42549508/2026/CVE-2026-56170.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-56170.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0641.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0449","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0449.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54058","title":"Python Pillow McIdas AREA 文件处理越界读取漏洞","description":"Pillow（Python 图像处理库）在处理 McIdas AREA 格式图像文件时存在越界读取漏洞。当通过文件路径加载未压缩的 McIdas AREA 图像时，攻击者可通过构造特制的图像文件头字段，将行步长（stride）设置为远小于实际行宽的值。由于 map.c 中仅校验 offset + ysize*stride 不超过缓冲区长度，未检查 stride 是否大于等于自然行宽（xsize * pixelsize），导致后续像素访问操作（如 tobytes、getpixel、convert、save）从映射区域外读取相邻进程内存，造成敏感信息泄露或触发 SIGBUS 导致拒绝服务。攻击者只需诱使用户打开恶意构造的 McIdas AREA 图像文件即可触发，无需任何认证。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.3.0 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54058","GHSA-62p4-gmf7-7g93"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:17:03Z","updated":"2026-07-15T20:08:02Z","remediation":"立即将 Pillow 升级至 12.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade Pillow`），该版本在 `src/map.c` 的 `PyImaging_MapBuffer` 中增加了 `stride >= im->linesize` 校验，并在 `McIdasImagePlugin.py` 中增加了对 `offset` 和 `stride` 的输入验证。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 McIdas 插件支持（删除或重命名 `PIL/McIdasImagePlugin.py`），或避免直接以文件路径方式打开用户上传的 McIdas AREA 图像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/6a8de891fb00968e5ea79bfa84368ed90b3cfc1d","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9719","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-62p4-gmf7-7g93","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54058.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54058.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/Pillow/CVE-2026-54058.yml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1994996b0b1043aeb0b2d4db6d06b7a742460e16/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54058.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54058","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54058.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54058.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54058.md","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/pyproject.toml","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/pillow/PYSEC-2026-3493.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0449.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0449.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1144","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1144.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49805","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32K 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32K 组件存在不正确的访问控制漏洞。已通过身份验证的本地低权限攻击者可通过特制操作触发该缺陷，以高复杂度利用方式在无需用户交互的情况下提升系统权限。成功利用后，攻击者可获取受保护系统资源的完全访问权限，导致机密性、完整性和可用性均面临高风险。该漏洞影响受支持的 Windows 操作系统版本，CVSS v3.1 评分 7.0，Microsoft 已在 2026 年 7 月安全更新中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49805"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-14T17:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-22T16:17:34Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 7 月安全更新。受影响系统需升级至以下安全版本：Windows 10 Version 1607 升级至 10.0.14393.9339、Version 1809 升级至 10.0.17763.9020、Version 21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.7548、Version 22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.7548；Windows 11 24H2/25H2/26H1 分别升级至 10.0.26100.8875、10.0.26200.8875、10.0.28000.2525；Windows Server 2012/2012 R2 分别升级至 6.2.9200.26226、6.3.9600.23291，Server 2016/2019/2022/2025 分别升级至 10.0.14393.9339、10.0.17763.9020、10.0.20348.5386、10.0.26100.33158。可通过 Windows Update 或微软更新目录手动安装对应累积更新。如暂时无法打补丁，可采取临时缓解措施：通过本地安全策略限制低权限账户登录交互会话，并启用 AppLocker 或 WDAC 应用控制策略阻止未签名可执行文件运行，以降低本地提权风险。详情参见 https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-49805。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-49805","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49805.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f89e5c809343acea555b12ff38461dcb4bd93eb9/2026/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/7eec4fe001056c3e54a3937f07d8f3aaa576ccef/content/posts/cve-2026-49805.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-498xx/CVE-2026-49805.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-49805.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1144.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0691","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0691.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59205","title":"Python Pillow ImageCmsTransform 输出模式不匹配导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"Pillow 图像处理库的 ImageCmsTransform.apply() 接口存在堆越界写入漏洞。当调用者提供的输出图像色彩模式与变换声明的输出模式不匹配时（例如将 RGBA→RGBA 变换应用于 L 模式图像），底层 LittleCMS 会按每像素 4 字节写入，而 L 模式图像每行仅分配每像素 1 字节的缓冲区，导致受控的堆内存越界写入。攻击者可通过构造特制的变换参数和输出图像对象触发该漏洞，造成堆元数据损坏或任意地址写入，最终导致拒绝服务或潜在代码执行。该漏洞影响 Pillow 12.3.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59205","GHSA-9hw9-ch79-4vh6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T16:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-14T20:09:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pillow 至 12.3.0 或更高版本（对应 commit a9ffc42）。如无法立即升级，可在调用 ImageCmsTransform.apply() 前手动校验 im.mode 与 self.input_mode、imOut.mode 与 self.output_mode 是否一致，拒绝不匹配的输入输出图像模式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/commit/a9ffc42bedf4fc0a7ef8d6486e7f9e81e3397721","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/pull/9715","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/releases/tag/12.3.0","https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/security/advisories/GHSA-9hw9-ch79-4vh6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59205.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59205.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-592xx/CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/afc0df6edf4ea320b0cfac74a53aafd9b4a9697f/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59205.json","https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub/blob/53064c2d9b41f77a141736ad6eb037966174329b/docs/managed-datahub/release-notes/v_2_1_0.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0691.toml"}]